-**CRITICAL: Use ONLY --robot-* flags. Bare bv launches an interactive TUI that blocks your session.**
+**CRITICAL: Use ONLY `scripts/bv_compat.sh --robot-*` invocations. Bare `bv` both bypasses the status compatibility layer and launches an interactive TUI that blocks your session.**
 
